# build_sources.ignore — files intentionally not wired into any build target.
#
# Consumed by scripts/validate_sources.py (STRICT mode in CI). Entries are
# gitignore-style paths relative to the repo root. Each file below is a
# pre-existing orphan: header-only modules included transitively, optional
# GPU (.cuh/.cu) headers, or stand-alone test sources not yet registered in a
# CMake test target. Listing them explicitly keeps STRICT validation active so
# any *newly* added orphan source still fails the build.

